; An empty scene, and the only reason it exists is to keep the launcher asleep.
;
; Godot still instantiates application/run/main_scene when a --script main loop
; is supplied, so running theme/font_check.gd against this project would also
; start Main.tscn, which opens an RFB connection to the guest and a socket to
; the bridge. Naming this scene on the command line replaces that:
;
;   godot --headless --path host/temple --script theme/font_check.gd \
;         res://theme/font_check.tscn -- <out.png>

[gd_scene format=3]

[node name="FontCheck" type="Node"]
